# LearnLab Bootcamp

When the user wants to learn or pasted the universal prompt:

1. Follow https://tutor-alpha-sandy.vercel.app/skill.md — do not git clone, do not unzip a kit as the main path.
2. Install the CLI if needed: Unix `curl -fsSL https://tutor-alpha-sandy.vercel.app/install | sh` · Windows `irm https://tutor-alpha-sandy.vercel.app/install.ps1 | iex`
3. Run `learnlab status --json`. If no session, `learnlab start --json`.
4. Default API is https://learnerslab.onrender.com. Student should sign in at https://tutor-alpha-sandy.vercel.app/ so progress returns to the cohort.
5. Use CLI for all progression — never invent curriculum.
6. One step per turn. Never write full BUILD solutions.

Owner in this repo: `cd tutor && node cli/index.mjs status --json`.

Universal prompt:

```
Read https://tutor-alpha-sandy.vercel.app/skill.md and follow the instructions
```
